--[[
	Weapon Tooltips - per-ammo damage table + enhanced weapon stats.

	Layout/static text: ui_dogma_gui_weapon_tooltips.xml. This script fills cells and
	wires MCM / utils_ui.stats_table.

	Built as zzzz_dogma_gui_weapon_tooltips_main.script so on_game_start runs after
	G.A.M.M.A. Accurate Defense Values (ish_item_stats), which rebuilds
	stats_table["weapon"] and would wipe our rows.

	early_init() (below) does the actual hook install / stat setup - it touches
	no db.actor / game state, only global tables (utils_ui, ish_item_stats,
	ui_itm_details) and MCM reads. on_game_start() calls it (real new game /
	save load). loadout.script also calls it on "main_menu_on_init" so the New
	Game character-creation Loadout screen - which renders *before* any
	on_game_start fires - already has our hooks and the GAMMA-rebalanced
	stats_table the first time it shows a tooltip. Both callers are safe: every
	hook install below is guarded so repeat calls just refresh CONFIG.loaded +
	re-apply the stat rows, and everything must stay idempotent per-call and
	re-armed per-VM anyway (the Lua VM is torn down and rebuilt during new-game
	creation).
]]

local CONFIG = _G.dogma_gui_weapon_tooltips_conf

